                                "sense_id": "b1bb7f92-765d-34dc-8172-47196fc65154",
                                "text": "Was it to be borne, that when the Slaves had been emancipated in the West Indies, and the Factory children had, been relieved from their incessant labour, that they were still to be doomed to the servile condition of Faggery, and be kept six hours a-day in school?"
                            },
